I have changed the result of calling `toString` for the following functions as specified.
```js
/* built-in function */
Math.pow.toString()
// function pow() {
// 	[native code]
// }
//

/* bound function */
(function(){}).bind().toString()
// function bound () {
// 	[native code]
// }
//

/* Java Method */
java.math.BigInteger.valueOf.toString()
// function valueOf() {
// 	[native code]
// }
//

/* getter/setter */
Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor({ get p() {} }, 'p').get.toString()
// get p() {}
```

Previously, the results were as follows.
```js
/* built-in function */
Math.pow.toString()
// function pow() {
// 	[native code, arity=2]
// }
//

/* bound function */
(function(){}).bind().toString()
// function bound () {
// 	[native code, arity=0]
// }
//

/* Java Method */
java.math.BigInteger.valueOf.toString()
// function valueOf() {/*
// java.math.BigInteger valueOf(long)
// */}
// 

/* getter/setter */
Object.getOwnPropertyDescriptor({ get p() {} }, 'p').get.toString()
// p() {}
```

